# Step 2, once the live VMs have been read (docs/context.md):
# rename to imports.tf, then
#   terraform plan -generate-config-out=generated_vms.tf
# Terraform writes the resources from the real VMs: the first plan shows no
# change, like the switches with "state: gathered". Review, then
#   terraform apply   (imports into the state, changes nothing on Proxmox)
#
# VMIDs from the piscine docs (convention: 2400-2499 MGMT, 1000-1999 PROD,
# 8000-8999 templates), node to confirm:
#
# import {
#   to = proxmox_virtual_environment_vm.pbs
#   id = "pve02/2400"
# }
# import {
#   to = proxmox_virtual_environment_vm.dhcp_dns
#   id = "<node>/2401"
# }
# ... 2405 ansible, 2406 prometheus01, 2407 grafana01, 1001 nettest,
#     8001 ubuntu2404-template; 2402 vault and 2403 rproxy-int01 are LXC
#     (proxmox_virtual_environment_container).
